":37,"sd":null},{"k":"47:38","t":"Here you are - those invited to spend in the cause of Allāh - but among you are those who withhold [out of greed]. And whoever withholds only withholds [benefit] from himself; and Allāh is the Free of need, while you are the needy. And if you turn away [i.e., refuse], He will replace you with another people; then they will not be the likes of you.","j":26,"h":51,"s":47,"a":38,"sd":null}],"juz":26,"hizb":51,"surahs":[47],"sajdah":false}